<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραγμᾰτ-ειώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>laborious, like
				work</i> rather than play, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					137b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>serious, important, based on reality,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					1299.4
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in Int.</u>
				86.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>concerned with facts</i> or <i>realities, material,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογικός</span> (formal), <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.820S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				201
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Cat.</u>
					194.4
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				123.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diotog.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.7.62
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δέως</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1762.5
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστέρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Grg.</u>
					p.355
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i></div>
